{
 "id": "01078ae5-c502-4578-b73d-487d2a1e70d4",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Ex-Husband Demands Reunion"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "전남편이 재결합을 요구합니다"
   },
   {
    "en": "My Ex-Husband Demands Our Reunion"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Her one-night stand with the dashing earl was no dream!\n\nShe was divorced by her husband, a count, and sentenced to death by her wicked mother-in-law for harassing the queen's daughter-in-law.\nEven if the plot is predictable, you can't die. Life is precious.\n\n“I'll give you a divorce!\n\nI quickly stamped the divorce decree.\nWhat's next?\n\n“Welcome to Sea World!”\n\nI welcomed my hostess daughter-in-law.\nLast but not least, I have to go out and make a good living!\nI, the one who knows the future of books, the path of a chaebol is an open door. \nSo it was time to shout, “Goodbye, everyone!”\n\n“Mother, I love you, I can't live without you!”\n\nDaughter-in-law, what's wrong?\n\n“Ma'am, the contemplation period is meant to give you time to think about whether you really need to get a divorce.”\n\nHusband Is he weird too?\nThe doctor's diagnosis that sent me running for the hills.",
   "ko": "소설 속 절륜한 백작님과의 원나잇은 꿈이 아니었다!\n\n지독한 패악질로 백작 남편에게 이혼당하고, 왕비 며느리를 괴롭히다 사형당하는 악녀 시어머니에게로 책빙의했다.\n뻔한 전개라도 죽을 순 없다. 생명은 소중하니까.\n\n‘해드리겠습니다! 그까짓 이혼!’\n\n얼른 이혼 확정 도장부터 찍었다.\n그다음엔 개과천선인가요?\n\n“웰컴 투 시월드!”\n\n여주인 며느리를 환대했다.\n마지막은 나가서도 잘살아야죠!\n책의 미래를 아는 나, 재벌의 길은 열린 문. \n그렇게 “안녕히 계세요! 여러분!”을 외칠 때가 됐는데.\n\n“어머님! 사랑해요! 전 어머님 없이 못 살아요!”\n\n며느리 왜 이래?\n\n“부인, 이혼 숙려 기간이란, 이혼을 꼭 해야 하는지 잘 생각해 보라는 뜻의 제도입니다.”\n\n남편도 좀 이상한?\n그러다 기어코 나를 도주하게 만든 의사의 진단."
  },
